WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:10.230
Submit your fanart to the Soul Contract producers here at: soulcontractanime.tumblr.com/submit

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:50.660
Soul Contract

00:01:52.869 --> 00:01:55.232
14th Contract

00:01:57.089 --> 00:01:59.619
Subbed by E.P. of Bayi Subs

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:04.794
Duanmu Xi

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:06.140
That fox spirit said

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:08.380
he used to be a Yangming Master's Soul Image

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:09.950
He was my dad's Soul Image

00:02:11.463 --> 00:02:15.336
My dad was the first to take a youkai as Soul Image

00:02:16.083 --> 00:02:17.445
That fox spirit

00:02:17.445 --> 00:02:19.742
is way more dangerous than you think

00:02:19.979 --> 00:02:21.677
Next time if you meet him again,

00:02:21.677 --> 00:02:22.630
remember,

00:02:22.630 --> 00:02:23.740
don't challenge him

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:25.280
You must protect yourself

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:27.130
Run if you can

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:32.600
How do you manage to break through the barrier of Duanmu house?

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:34.950
The barrier is indeed formidable

00:02:34.958 --> 00:02:37.818
but my barrier isn't just for display

00:02:37.810 --> 00:02:39.320
Mine very own territory

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:42.520
allows me to access the Duanmu's house with no difficulty

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:48.580
Get lost

00:02:48.583 --> 00:02:50.213
Duanmu Xi is not yours

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:56.780
Not mine?

00:02:56.786 --> 00:02:58.522
You meant he's yours?

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:04.310
This is not the way to use the Luoye sword

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:11.020
I promised Duanmu Xi that I won't hurt you

00:03:11.022 --> 00:03:12.872
but it doesn't mean

00:03:12.872 --> 00:03:15.943
I won't let others hurt you

00:03:18.231 --> 00:03:19.182
What?

00:03:25.113 --> 00:03:26.331
What is it?

00:03:26.567 --> 00:03:27.819
Master Siming

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:29.410
The 2nd Lady is resting

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:31.400
Just tell me what's the problem

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:32.260
Yes

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:35.270
Miss Qin has released the Young Master's Soul Image

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:36.005
We...

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:37.140
I understand

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:39.580
I will pass the message to her

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:40.560
But...

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.900
You may leave

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:43.830
Yes

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:50.130
Come, Yang Jinghua

00:03:50.131 --> 00:03:52.597
Let's see your ugly face

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:56.800
You're awake

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:58.600
Release Yang Jinghua

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:01.122
You're so weak,

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:03.080
you still want to threaten me?

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:07.740
I've said it already

00:04:07.746 --> 00:04:08.809
Other than me,

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:11.780
no one else is allowed to touch my Soul Image

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:13.800
But he attacked you

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:17.630
Since you're awake

00:04:17.639 --> 00:04:19.736
How about we go for a sideshow?

00:04:20.180 --> 00:04:21.200
Long Yu

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:23.490
I am here

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:26.980
Do as I told you before

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:27.940
Yes

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:31.680
W-What are you trying to do?

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:33.520
I want you to see

00:04:33.529 --> 00:04:37.778
if it's really worth sacrificing so much for this Soul Image?

00:04:38.669 --> 00:04:39.686
Where

00:04:39.686 --> 00:04:41.063
Where am I?

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:44.570
This is Lord Yinzhe's barrier of fox spirit

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.520
Our Lord has ordered us

00:04:46.528 --> 00:04:48.935
to teach you a lesson

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:51.403
It wasn't easy to get out of the cage

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:52.800
but now I'm in a barrier

00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:54.140
When will I gonna be free?

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:58.740
I won't let you all get away if you dare lay a finger on Duanmu Xi

00:05:00.452 --> 00:05:03.421
You are the one who pierced the Yangming Master

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:04.160
Long Yu

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:05.640
Stop wasting time with him

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:07.210
He is brazen-faced

00:05:07.218 --> 00:05:09.922
Lord Yinzhe is actually protecting Master Duanmu

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:11.440
This guy is blind

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:13.060
Can't even tell right or wrong

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:14.150
Shut up!

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:17.410
Hey

00:05:17.410 --> 00:05:18.800
Useless Soul Image

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:21.240
Why don't you pick on someone your own size

00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:23.260
I'm your opponent

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:26.430
Oh yeah

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:31.060
Lord Yinzhe purposely gave you second chance to repent

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:32.740
As long as you declare that

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:34.900
you willingly break the Soul Contract

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:37.600
You'll no longer have any connection with Duanmu Xi

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:38.720
It's that simple

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:40.660
You go tell that damn red-haired

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:42.300
If he wants to hear me say it,

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:44.140
better luck next life

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:45.360
Long Yu

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:46.960
He is wearing spirit garment

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:48.610
He's not easy to defeat

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:51.600
Your master seriously sacrificed a lot

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:52.570
Let me tell you

00:05:52.572 --> 00:05:54.649
I have great defense,

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:56.540
a sacred weapon Luoye in my hand

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:57.850
I'm invincible

00:05:57.852 --> 00:05:59.345
I ain't fearing you

00:06:11.763 --> 00:06:14.040
Don't be so cocky, brat

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:17.150
How can your clothes protect you entirely?

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.280
There're some places it can't protect, right?

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:21.350
Face,

00:06:21.357 --> 00:06:22.419
neck,

00:06:22.419 --> 00:06:23.422
hand,

00:06:23.422 --> 00:06:24.545
ankle

00:06:24.545 --> 00:06:27.123
I am a blade youkai

00:06:27.123 --> 00:06:30.700
There's nothing I can't penetrate or break

00:06:30.900 --> 00:06:32.620
Painful, isn't it?

00:06:32.621 --> 00:06:34.483
I know I'm already dead

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:37.180
It's impossible to get my hand chopped off but

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:39.840
why does the pain feel so real just now?

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:41.580
Yes, it's painful

00:06:41.589 --> 00:06:42.699
Just say it

00:06:42.699 --> 00:06:45.808
Say that you wish to break the Soul Contract

00:06:51.248 --> 00:06:52.342
What are you doing?

00:06:52.342 --> 00:06:53.606
Why lock me up?

00:06:53.606 --> 00:06:54.610
Miss Qin

00:06:54.610 --> 00:06:57.746
You selfishly released the family's convicted spirit

00:06:57.746 --> 00:06:59.730
You should stay in here and repent

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:00.762
What?

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:02.490
Don't worry

00:07:02.495 --> 00:07:04.822
You'll be released in several days

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:06.580
Several days?

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:07.760
Duanmu Siming

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:09.190
What are you guys up to?

00:07:09.197 --> 00:07:10.541
Our family business

00:07:10.541 --> 00:07:12.639
has got nothing to do with you

00:07:13.728 --> 00:07:16.433
What are you planning to do to Duanmu Xi?

00:07:16.707 --> 00:07:19.269
Duanmu Siming

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:22.600
Yang Jinghua

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:25.110
Please, I'm counting on you

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:27.220
Don't mess it up this time

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:28.260
You're wearing

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:31.050
the spirit clothes that he gave you

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:32.780
Hurry up and say it

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:35.320
Break the Soul Contract

00:07:44.184 --> 00:07:46.475
He's in grave danger

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:54.160
You're wounded

00:07:54.163 --> 00:07:56.648
You should rest more

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:58.720
Didn't you taught me

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:01.340
not to take an enemy lightly?

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:02.500
Enemy?

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:03.780
Young Master,

00:08:03.789 --> 00:08:07.980
these words you speak really pains me

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:19.100
Why do you still worry about him?

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:22.280
Didn't you only sign a one-sided contract with him?

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:24.110
Cut the crap

00:08:24.414 --> 00:08:26.554
I won't let you

00:08:26.819 --> 00:08:30.757
hurt him

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:46.140
Little Soul Image

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:48.970
You're so easily defeated

00:08:48.976 --> 00:08:50.763
Once I destroy your clothes,

00:08:50.763 --> 00:08:53.929
you'll be completely defenseless

00:08:53.929 --> 00:08:56.540
Be good and beg for mercy

00:08:56.555 --> 00:08:57.380
Long Yu

00:08:57.680 --> 00:08:58.560
Let go

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:00.580
Lord Yinzhe

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:01.740
Why?

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:14.390
Lord Yinzhe

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:17.500
You girls get some rest

00:09:17.507 --> 00:09:19.399
Let me do it

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:23.740
Do you know why your master

00:09:23.744 --> 00:09:25.727
limit your boundary?

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:27.420
It's because

00:09:27.444 --> 00:09:29.450
he can't sense your presence

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:32.430
You're like a dog getting chained

00:09:32.430 --> 00:09:35.463
Soul Image and Yangming Master share a soul

00:09:35.463 --> 00:09:37.414
Soul energy in communion

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:39.040
Glory is shared

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:40.650
Destruction is shared

00:09:40.883 --> 00:09:43.244
Neither one can survive alone

00:09:43.244 --> 00:09:44.978
As for you and Duanmu

00:09:44.978 --> 00:09:46.867
is only a one-sided contract

00:09:46.867 --> 00:09:49.272
If he dies, you die too

00:09:49.272 --> 00:09:51.507
But whether you live or die,

00:09:51.746 --> 00:09:54.336
it will never affect him

00:09:54.336 --> 00:09:55.805
Do you get it?

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:58.897
Duanmu Xi never trusted you

00:09:58.897 --> 00:10:02.041
He never treats you as his Soul Image

00:10:03.398 --> 00:10:05.052
Then what about you?

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:06.700
According to what you say,

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:09.560
Yangming Master and Soul Image live and die together

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:12.160
The previous Yangming Master is already dead, isn't he?

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:14.060
So why are you still alive?

00:10:14.068 --> 00:10:17.117
You're the one who never got trusted, aren't you?

00:10:17.554 --> 00:10:20.255
You have no right to talk about me!

00:10:24.642 --> 00:10:26.843
Humans are all liars

00:10:26.843 --> 00:10:29.357
They're the first to break the promise

00:10:29.357 --> 00:10:32.966
Why should I bother to keep their promises?

00:10:36.060 --> 00:10:36.990
Remember

00:10:36.998 --> 00:10:39.254
If you meet Yinzhe, don't challenge him

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:40.840
You must protect yourself

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:42.510
Run if you can

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:50.780
If I run,

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:52.000
what about you?

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:54.460
Are you going to face danger alone?

00:10:55.700 --> 00:10:57.260
To be protected by you

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:58.540
To run

00:10:58.545 --> 00:11:00.047
To get defeated

00:11:00.047 --> 00:11:01.358
So what?

00:11:01.350 --> 00:11:04.140
What difference does it make?

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.450
I still don't improve

00:11:06.702 --> 00:11:08.624
You may consider me

00:11:08.624 --> 00:11:10.251
as your family

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:13.200
Is there nothing

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:15.680
I can do for you?

00:11:15.686 --> 00:11:17.484
I want to respond to you

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:19.220
Duanmu Xi

00:11:21.159 --> 00:11:23.000
Duanmu Xi

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:32.890
Duanmu Xi!!!

00:11:55.234 --> 00:11:56.499
Is that guy

00:11:56.490 --> 00:11:58.680
still the idiotic Yang Jinghua?

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:01.990
The form he has taken is actually

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:04.720
the World's No. 1 Skilled Master,

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:06.230
Yang Zicheng,

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:07.930
Yangning

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:14.540
The aura in the wind

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:16.580
has changed
